As we are now approaching your last day with the BHKLab, we need to begin t=
he off-boarding procedure. There are two meetings we need to set up:
 Initialization Meeting

To get you started, we will meet and go through the BHKLab Offboarding Poli=
cy<https://bhklab.github.io/handbook/dev/onboarding_offboarding/Offboarding=
/>. Feel free to read through it prior to our meeting.


For your offboarding, I have created two folders:

  1.
Off-boarding report folder: [INSERT LINK]
  2.
Personal folder: [INSET LINK]

I=92ll explain what these are for when we meet. Please confirm you can acce=
ss them both.


Exit Interview

This will be scheduled for the day prior to your official last day (or near=
 that, based on your availability). We will confirm what we discussed in th=
e initialization meeting and ensure all lab assets have been returned.

You will also be expected to complete the Exit Interview Form<https://docs.=
google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdnpTBRTcUmjQ0cnfP9MrN455Oy7tnW1JyRA4cgarvCs56p=
mQ/viewform?usp=3Dsharing>. Please do this before the Exit Interview meetin=
g.



Let me know of your availability for these proposed times:

  *   Initialization Meeting: [DATE] @ [TIME]
  *   Exit Interview:  [DATE] @ [TIME]
 If you have any questions leading up to our meeting, let me know.

--_000_YT1PR01MB404276B5CB1FA5DECDCF5916F3FE2YT1PR01MB4042CANP_
